This project downloads, compiles, links against, and documents behavior of
Lean 4. Lean 4 is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 and carries
its own upstream copyright notices, including notices in source files such as
`src/library/ir_interpreter.cpp`.

The artifact builder materializes the catalogued Lean source under the ignored
`_sources/lean` directory, or accepts another clean checkout at that exact
revision. It is not committed to this repository. Generated WASM artifacts may
include object code compiled from Lean 4 source; retain Lean's license and
upstream notices when distributing those artifacts.
